# Supabase
.branches
.temp

# NOTE: migrations/ is intentionally NOT ignored. Ignoring it left 18 of 22 RLS/schema
# migrations untracked, so policy changes could not be reviewed, diffed or replayed from a
# clean checkout (a fresh `supabase db reset` applied 4 files against a hand-built schema).
# These files contain schema DDL only - no keys, no credentials.

